{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"863330707589431306","content":"Editorial:\nHeadline: Rapscallion Rebel Scum Seen Rousting Rooftops\nWe already know that the rebels operate in the deepest bowels of the City. It appears that the Rebels are now attacking the colonies from the sky as well. Several eye witness reports have claimed that a flying hooligan has been terrorizing the local rooftops.\nThis hooligan has been causing a terrible ruckus and interrupting several British officers in their conjugal exploits that are the very core tenant that sustains the Empire in perpetuity forever and ever. God save the King. Amen.\nWherefore are we now to see these \"martyrs of freedom. What is next? Terrorizing us in our evening baths? I, for one, will not stand for it. I refuse to. I am a Englishman and damnit I will not be looking over my shoulder waiting for the hawkish rebels to swoop down upon mine. Wrenching asunder what foothold the King exerts here. This is of course our imperative to snuff this fire out. Once and for all!","created_at":"2021-07-12T04:25:12.023000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863999411452903466","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
